(
    title: "Dark Chambers",
    developer: Some("Adam Clayton, John Howard Palevich"),
    description: Some("A 26-level descent through a ghoul-infested dungeon, alone or with a partner: enemies mutate into the next weaker form each time they\'re shot — grim reapers down through wizards and skeletons to exploding zombies — while spawners hatch new ones and hide the loot. Strength is life: touches, traps and poison drain it and potions restore it, with guns, daggers, shields and bombs to tilt the fight, keys for the locked doors, and a hidden gate on every level leading further down."),
